[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10501.15, "timestamp": "02:55:01", "text": "the humble thatched"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10504.63, "timestamp": "02:55:04", "text": "cottages. And where his home once stood,"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10508.75, "timestamp": "02:55:08", "text": "only an empty wasteland"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10511.03, "timestamp": "02:55:11", "text": "remained. He noticed a date on the"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10513.59, "timestamp": "02:55:13", "text": "calendar that he had never seen before."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10516.07, "timestamp": "02:55:16", "text": "In shock, he grabbed a passer by and"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10518.95, "timestamp": "02:55:18", "text": "urgently asked, \"Excuse me, can you tell"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10522.15, "timestamp": "02:55:22", "text": "me the current date and time?\" I don't"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10525.51, "timestamp": "02:55:25", "text": "date and time. As he heard the answer,"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10526.83, "timestamp": "02:55:26", "text": "his legs went"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10529.63, "timestamp": "02:55:29", "text": "weak. Everything had"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10533.269, "timestamp": "02:55:33", "text": "changed. Time had passed and his loved"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10535.309, "timestamp": "02:55:35", "text": "ones were"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10543.83, "timestamp": "02:55:43", "text": "So, the wood cutter left Mount"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10546.55, "timestamp": "02:55:46", "text": "Firmament, but how is he still alive and"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10549.03, "timestamp": "02:55:49", "text": "kicking with a hundred years worth of"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10551.63, "timestamp": "02:55:51", "text": "time inside him? Shouldn't"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10555.91, "timestamp": "02:55:55", "text": "he? Your story, it's a bit far-fetched,"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10558.95, "timestamp"